  "description": "Categorize code graph files into source, test, and ignored with configurable project/workspace patterns. Exclude test callers and candidates from production blast radius risk calculations and hotspot rankings by default with physical SQL pushdown. Provide --category, --include-tests, --include-ignored, and --all CLI flags with clear omission notices in impact, hotspots, and search commands.",
